  unitName: Kaiser Gloomy
  unitId: 60032
  unitNumber: 1084
  description: The Kaiser Gloomy is the evolved form of a King Gloomy which was exposed
    to pure evil energy while roaming Ishgria. Though it tends to spit out obscenities
    and profanity about everything around it, the Kaiser Gloomy's habit of saying
    something nice in the midst of it all remains a part of its personality. The
    bat-like things that surround it don't really serve much purpose, though they
    can be heard whispering vulgarities as they fly about. Some Kaiser Gloomy are
    known to rule over other Gloomy by establishing hierarchical colonies within
    caves.
  summonDesc: You must have a lot of guts<br>to have summoned me.<br>You'd make a
    good minion!
  fusionDesc: What the heck is this?<br>You're a stingy one, aren't you?<br>Oh well.
    Thanks, I guess.
  evoDesc: '"I evolved! But what''s with the face?<br>You got a problem, or something?<br>I
    can evolve if I want to, you know!'
  element: 6
  rarity: 2
